{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1782045200620,"sessionID":"ses_115d69059ffepYpzQ2TcD57L0o","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-a10088da5605013b","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Book API\n\nA REST API service for managing a book collection, written in Go using only the\nstandard library `net/http` (with Go 1.22+ method-based routing) and an embedded\nSQLite database (via the pure-Go `modernc.org/sqlite` driver — no CGO required).\n\n## Endpoints\n\n| Method | Path            | Description                          |\n|--------|-----------------|--------------------------------------|\n| GET    | `/health`       | Health check                         |\n| POST   | `/books`        | Create a new book                    |\n| GET    | `/books`        | List all books (`?author=` filter)   |\n| GET    | `/books/{id}`   | Get a single book by ID              |\n| PUT    | `/books/{id}`   | Update a book                        |\n| DELETE | `/books/{id}`   | Delete a book                        |\n\n### Book payload\n\n```json\n{\n  \"title\":  \"The Go Programming Language\",\n  \"author\": \"Donovan & Kernighan\",\n  \"year\":   2015,\n  \"isbn\":   \"978-0134190440\"\n}\n```\n\n`title` and `author` are required; `year` and `isbn` are optional.\n\n## Setup\n\n```bash\ngo mod tidy\n```\n\n## Run\n\n```bash\ngo run .\n# listens on :8080, uses ./books.db\n```\n\nFlags:\n\n```bash\ngo run . -addr=:8080 -db=books.db\n# Use -db=:memory: for an in-memory database\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n```bash\n# Create\ncurl -s localhost:8080/books -d '{\"title\":\"T\",\"author\":\"A\",\"year\":2020}' | jq\n\n# List\ncurl -s localhost:8080/books | jq\n\n# Filter by author\ncurl -s 'localhost:8080/books?author=A' | jq\n\n# Update\ncurl -s -X PUT localhost:8080/books/1 -d '{\"title\":\"T2\",\"author\":\"A\"}' | jq\n\n# Delete\ncurl -s -X DELETE localhost:8080/books/1 -i\n```\n\n## Tests\n\n```bash\ngo test ./...\n```\n\nThe suite (`api_test.go`) covers:\n1. Create → List → Get → Delete lifecycle plus `?author=` filtering.\n2. Input validation (missing `title`/`author`) and bad ID handling.\n3. Update (full and missing-resource paths) plus the health check.\n","filePath":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-z0i76flh/retort-581b9182ea96/README.md"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/private/var/folders/t6/p1v727892_qc9xqqdzq2rpym0000gn/T/retort-local-z0i76flh/retort-581b9182ea96/README.md","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"README.md","time":{"start":1782045200616,"end":1782045200619}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_eea2b81a60014u18FdQ53t4Tzv","sessionID":"ses_115d69059ffepYpzQ2TcD57L0o","messageID":"msg_eea2b7c93001YjgA657cZZWT6y"}}
